# TASK-QA-010: this one script is a genuine CI dependency (.github/workflows/ci.yml
# runs it), unlike the rest of /scripts/ (local-only dev tooling -- DMG signing,
# notarization, backup/restore -- that needs local credentials CI never has). It
# must actually exist in a fresh checkout for the workflow to run at all. Git can't
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded via a trailing-slash pattern
# (`/scripts/`), hence `/scripts/*` here instead -- the standard "ignore all but
# these" idiom.
!/scripts/verify_acceptance_criteria.py
audit.md
fix-log.md
implementation-log.md
